{"page":242,"verses":[{"verse_key":"12:53","surah":12,"ayah":53,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَمَآ أُبَرِّئُ نَفْسِىٓ ۚ إِنَّ ٱلنَّفْسَ لَأَمَّارَةٌۢ بِٱلسُّوٓءِ إِلَّا مَا رَحِمَ رَبِّىٓ ۚ إِنَّ رَبِّى غَفُورٌ رَّحِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"I do not pretend to be blameless, for man’s very soul incites him to evil unless my Lord shows mercy: He is most forgiving, most merciful.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَمَآ","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"12:53"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أُبَرِّئُ","en_gloss":"I absolve","transliteration":"ubarri-u","verse_key":"12:53"},{"pos":3,"ar":"نَفْسِىٓ ۚ","en_gloss":"myself","transliteration":"nafsī","verse_key":"12:53"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"12:53"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلنَّفْسَ","en_gloss":"the soul","transliteration":"l-nafsa","verse_key":"12:53"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَأَمَّارَةٌۢ","en_gloss":"(is) a certain enjoiner","transliteration":"la-ammāratun","verse_key":"12:53"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِٱلسُّوٓءِ","en_gloss":"of evil","transliteration":"bil-sūi","verse_key":"12:53"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"unless","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"12:53"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"[that]","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"12:53"},{"pos":10,"ar":"رَحِمَ","en_gloss":"bestows Mercy","transliteration":"raḥima","verse_key":"12:53"},{"pos":11,"ar":"رَبِّىٓ ۚ","en_gloss":"my Lord","transliteration":"rabbī","verse_key":"12:53"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"12:53"},{"pos":13,"ar":"رَبِّى","en_gloss":"my Lord","transliteration":"rabbī","verse_key":"12:53"},{"pos":14,"ar":"غَفُورٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"ghafūrun","verse_key":"12:53"},{"pos":15,"ar":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"Most Merciful","transliteration":"raḥīmun","verse_key":"12:53"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٥٣","en_gloss":"(53)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"12:53"}]},{"verse_key":"12:54","surah":12,"ayah":54,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالَ ٱلْمَلِكُ ٱئْتُونِى بِهِۦٓ أَسْتَخْلِصْهُ لِنَفْسِى ۖ فَلَمَّا كَلَّمَهُۥ قَالَ إِنَّكَ ٱلْيَوْمَ لَدَيْنَا مَكِينٌ أَمِينٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The king said, ‘Bring him to me: I will have him serve me personally,’ and then, once he had spoken with him, ‘From now on you will have our trust and favour.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَالَ","en_gloss":"And said","transliteration":"waqāla","verse_key":"12:54"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْمَلِكُ","en_gloss":"the king","transliteration":"l-maliku","verse_key":"12:54"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱئْتُونِى","en_gloss":"Bring him to me","transliteration":"i'tūnī","verse_key":"12:54"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِهِۦٓ","en_gloss":"Bring him to me","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"12:54"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَسْتَخْلِصْهُ","en_gloss":"I will select him","transliteration":"astakhliṣ'hu","verse_key":"12:54"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِنَفْسِى ۖ","en_gloss":"for myself","transliteration":"linafsī","verse_key":"12:54"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"Then when","transliteration":"falammā","verse_key":"12:54"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كَلَّمَهُۥ","en_gloss":"he spoke to him","transliteration":"kallamahu","verse_key":"12:54"},{"pos":9,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"he said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"12:54"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِنَّكَ","en_gloss":"Indeed, you","transliteration":"innaka","verse_key":"12:54"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْيَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(are) today","transliteration":"l-yawma","verse_key":"12:54"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَدَيْنَا","en_gloss":"with us","transliteration":"ladaynā","verse_key":"12:54"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مَكِينٌ","en_gloss":"firmly established","transliteration":"makīnun","verse_key":"12:54"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَمِينٌۭ","en_gloss":"(and) trusted","transliteration":"amīnun","verse_key":"12:54"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٥٤","en_gloss":"(54)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"12:54"}]},{"verse_key":"12:55","surah":12,"ayah":55,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ ٱجْعَلْنِى عَلَىٰ خَزَآئِنِ ٱلْأَرْضِ ۖ إِنِّى حَفِيظٌ عَلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Joseph said, ‘Put me in charge of the nation’s storehouses: I shall manage them prudently and carefully.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"12:55"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱجْعَلْنِى","en_gloss":"Appoint me","transliteration":"ij'ʿalnī","verse_key":"12:55"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"over","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"12:55"},{"pos":4,"ar":"خَزَآئِنِ","en_gloss":"(the) treasuries","transliteration":"khazāini","verse_key":"12:55"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۖ","en_gloss":"(of) the land","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"12:55"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِنِّى","en_gloss":"Indeed, I","transliteration":"innī","verse_key":"12:55"},{"pos":7,"ar":"حَفِيظٌ","en_gloss":"(will be) a guardian","transliteration":"ḥafīẓun","verse_key":"12:55"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَلِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"knowing","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"12:55"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٥٥","en_gloss":"(55)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"12:55"}]},{"verse_key":"12:56","surah":12,"ayah":56,"ar_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ مَكَّنَّا لِيُوسُفَ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ يَتَبَوَّأُ مِنْهَا حَيْثُ يَشَآءُ ۚ نُصِيبُ بِرَحْمَتِنَا مَن نَّشَآءُ ۖ وَلَا نُضِيعُ أَجْرَ ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"In this way We settled Joseph in that land to live wherever he wished: We grant Our mercy to whoever We will and do not fail to reward those who do good.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"And thus","transliteration":"wakadhālika","verse_key":"12:56"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَكَّنَّا","en_gloss":"We established","transliteration":"makkannā","verse_key":"12:56"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِيُوسُفَ","en_gloss":"[to] Yusuf","transliteration":"liyūsufa","verse_key":"12:56"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"12:56"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the land","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"12:56"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَتَبَوَّأُ","en_gloss":"to settle","transliteration":"yatabawwa-u","verse_key":"12:56"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِنْهَا","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"min'hā","verse_key":"12:56"},{"pos":8,"ar":"حَيْثُ","en_gloss":"where ever","transliteration":"ḥaythu","verse_key":"12:56"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَشَآءُ ۚ","en_gloss":"he willed","transliteration":"yashāu","verse_key":"12:56"},{"pos":10,"ar":"نُصِيبُ","en_gloss":"We bestow","transliteration":"nuṣību","verse_key":"12:56"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِرَحْمَتِنَا","en_gloss":"Our Mercy","transliteration":"biraḥmatinā","verse_key":"12:56"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"(on) whom","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"12:56"},{"pos":13,"ar":"نَّشَآءُ ۖ","en_gloss":"We will","transliteration":"nashāu","verse_key":"12:56"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"12:56"},{"pos":15,"ar":"نُضِيعُ","en_gloss":"We let go waste","transliteration":"nuḍīʿu","verse_key":"12:56"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أَجْرَ","en_gloss":"(the) reward","transliteration":"ajra","verse_key":"12:56"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) the good-doers","transliteration":"l-muḥ'sinīna","verse_key":"12:56"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٥٦","en_gloss":"(56)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"12:56"}]},{"verse_key":"12:57","surah":12,"ayah":57,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَأَجْرُ ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ خَيْرٌ لِّلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَكَانُوا۟ يَتَّقُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The reward of the Hereafter is best for those who believe and are mindful of God.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَأَجْرُ","en_gloss":"And surely (the) reward","transliteration":"wala-ajru","verse_key":"12:57"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Hereafter","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","verse_key":"12:57"},{"pos":3,"ar":"خَيْرٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) better","transliteration":"khayrun","verse_key":"12:57"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِّلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"for those who","transliteration":"lilladhīna","verse_key":"12:57"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"12:57"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَكَانُوا۟","en_gloss":"and are","transliteration":"wakānū","verse_key":"12:57"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَتَّقُونَ","en_gloss":"God conscious","transliteration":"yattaqūna","verse_key":"12:57"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٥٧","en_gloss":"(57)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"12:57"}]},{"verse_key":"12:58","surah":12,"ayah":58,"ar_uthmani":"وَجَآءَ إِخْوَةُ يُوسُفَ فَدَخَلُوا۟ عَلَيْهِ فَعَرَفَهُمْ وَهُمْ لَهُۥ مُنكِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Joseph’s brothers came and presented themselves before him. He recognized them- though they did not recognize him-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَجَآءَ","en_gloss":"And came","transliteration":"wajāa","verse_key":"12:58"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِخْوَةُ","en_gloss":"(the) brothers","transliteration":"ikh'watu","verse_key":"12:58"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يُوسُفَ","en_gloss":"(of) Yusuf","transliteration":"yūsufa","verse_key":"12:58"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَدَخَلُوا۟","en_gloss":"and they entered","transliteration":"fadakhalū","verse_key":"12:58"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","en_gloss":"upon him","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","verse_key":"12:58"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَعَرَفَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and he recognized them","transliteration":"faʿarafahum","verse_key":"12:58"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"but they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"12:58"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"knew him not","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"12:58"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مُنكِرُونَ","en_gloss":"knew him not","transliteration":"munkirūna","verse_key":"12:58"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٥٨","en_gloss":"(58)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"12:58"}]},{"verse_key":"12:59","surah":12,"ayah":59,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَمَّا جَهَّزَهُم بِجَهَازِهِمْ قَالَ ٱئْتُونِى بِأَخٍ لَّكُم مِّنْ أَبِيكُمْ ۚ أَلَا تَرَوْنَ أَنِّىٓ أُوفِى ٱلْكَيْلَ وَأَنَا۠ خَيْرُ ٱلْمُنزِلِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and once he had given them their provisions, he said, ‘Bring me the brother [you left with] your father! Have you not seen me giving generous measure and being the best of hosts?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"walammā","verse_key":"12:59"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جَهَّزَهُم","en_gloss":"h